#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:2
msgid "Tasks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:3
msgid "*Follow the exports of your recipes*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:5
msgid ""
"When you export or retrieve a recipe, SEPAL starts a task that runs in "
"the background. The **Tasks** tab works the same way for all recipes; "
"only the recipe type and name differ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:8
msgid "Tasks list"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:10
msgid ""
"Open the **Tasks** tab with the button in the lower-left corner of the "
"SEPAL interface to follow your exports. The button shows :icon:`fa-solid "
"fa-spinner` while tasks are running, and :icon:`fa-solid fa-list-check` "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:16
msgid ""
"Each task shows the recipe type and destination (e.g. **Radar Mosaic → "
"SEPAL workspace**), and the project and name of the recipe. A running "
"task displays a spinner and its current status (e.g. :code:`Google Earth "
"Engine is exporting`); once it has completed, a green check mark and the "
"duration of the task are displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:18
msgid ""
"You can filter the list with :guilabel:`All`, :guilabel:`Active`, "
":guilabel:`Completed` and :guilabel:`Failed / Canceled`, or find a task "
"with the **Search tasks** field. Select :btn:`<fa-solid fa-xmark>` to "
"stop a running task (you are asked to confirm), and :btn:`<fa-solid fa-"
"trash>` to remove a finished task from the list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:31
msgid "Task details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:33
msgid "Select a task to open its details:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Status**: the duration, submission time and completion (or last update)"
" time of the task."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Recipe configuration**: the recipe type and origin (project and recipe "
"name)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Location**: the destination and output path of the exported data and, "
"for exports to an Earth Engine asset, its access."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Progress**: the export progress, or the error message if the export has"
" failed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:40
msgid ""
"The task can also be monitored using the `GEE task manager "
"<https://code.earthengine.google.com/tasks>`__ or the `Tasks page in the "
"Google Cloud console <https://console.cloud.google.com/earth-"
"engine/tasks>`__ (select your Google Cloud project)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/feature/tasks.rst:44
msgid ""
"Tasks run between GEE and SEPAL servers in the background. You can close "
"the SEPAL page without stopping them."
msgstr ""

